Package: BIOsubmissions
Type: Package
Title: Process Oceanographic Data for International Platform Submissions
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Emily", "O'Grady", email = "emily.ogrady@dfo-mpo.gc.ca", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Emily O'Grady <emily.ogrady@dfo-mpo.gc.ca>
Description: Converts BioChem oceanographic data to formats required by 
    international data platforms (OCADS, CCHDO, SDG). Performs automated unit 
    conversions, quality flag translation, method name mapping, and data validation
    to ensure submissions meet platform requirements and catch common errors 
    (latitude/longitude issues, range errors, precision loss).
License: Internal DFO use
Encoding: UTF-8
